      "created_at": "2012-04-18T05:48:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was just curious about changes in the Enhanced Edition.  We know about scaling with H, hp tracking, errata, typos, and art for the environment cards.  Aside from changes to specific cards like Chastise or Wrest the Mind, are there going to be any “balance”-like changes?  For instance, increasing or decreasing damage of particular cards/powers?  I know that many people believe that certain characters are too weak/strong, and while characters in this game obviously don’t NEED to balanced in the same way that say, an MMO does, I was curious if there might be any changes like this in the Enhanced Edition.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:20.786Z",
