      "id": 28378,
      "name": "ketigid",
      "username": "ketigid",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-18T06:02:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I might as well copy-and-paste my questions about the Enhanced Edition here from the other thread.</p>\n<p>==================================<br>\nI will need more details on the Enhanced Second Edition before deciding.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Will the card back of all the decks be updated?</li>\n<li>Will any existing art be updated?</li>\n<li>Will the new box hold just the base game plus 2 expansions? Will there be space for a third or fourth expansion?</li>\n<li>Will the storage solution be sleeve friendly?</li>\n<li>Will Young Legacy be re-released with thicker card stock? This is just for OCD me.</li>\n<li>What will the HP counters look like?</li>\n<li>Will there be damage count modifier counters? Damage type modifier counters?</li>\n<li>Will the pdf for existing first edition owners include the remastered environment decks with new art?</li>\n</ol>\n<h1>Thanks! <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\">\n</h1>\n<p>Hope to see some answers soon. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:02:20.029Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 5634,
      "topic_slug": "what-all-is-enhanced-in-enhanced-edition",
      "display_username": "ketigid",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
