      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "I might as well copy-and-paste my questions about the Enhanced Edition here from the other thread.\n\n==================================\nI will need more details on the Enhanced Second Edition before deciding.\n\n1. Will the card back of all the decks be updated?\n2. Will any existing art be updated?\n3. Will the new box hold just the base game plus 2 expansions? Will there be space for a third or fourth expansion?\n4. Will the storage solution be sleeve friendly?\n5. Will Young Legacy be re-released with thicker card stock? This is just for OCD me.\n6. What will the HP counters look like?\n7. Will there be damage count modifier counters? Damage type modifier counters?\n8. Will the pdf for existing first edition owners include the remastered environment decks with new art?\n\nThanks! :)\n==================================\n\nHope to see some answers soon. :)",
