      "id": 28385,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-18T18:03:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Will the card back of all the decks be updated?<br>\nNot much if at all; that is up to Adam!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Will any existing art be updated?<br>\nYes; quite a bit, actually.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Will the new box hold just the base game plus 2 expansions? Will there be space for a third or fourth expansion?<br>\nJust core + 2 expansions for now.  If we release more expansions, we will release additional storage options at that time</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Will the storage solution be sleeve friendly?<br>\nYes.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Will Young Legacy be re-released with thicker card stock? This is just for OCD me.<br>\nNo.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>What will the HP counters look like?<br>\nSee Update <span class=\"hashtag\">#1</span> on Kickstarter!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Will there be damage count modifier counters? Damage type modifier counters?<br>\nYes to both.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Will the pdf for existing first edition owners include the remastered environment decks with new art?<br>\nYes.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:02:20.383Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
