      "created_at": "2012-04-19T04:17:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To give an example of what I originally meant.  Fanatic and Tachyon are two heroes that I could see benefiting greatly from the introduction of irreducible damage.  Sanctifying Strike in particular seems like it a prime target for it.  While I admit Hypersonic Assault is probably fine as is, I could see having Accelerated Assault’s be irreducible.</p>",
