      "created_at": "2012-04-20T23:17:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, it will. I’ve grown a lot as an artist in the past year, and as a result there are a lot of things I’m extremely unhappy with in first edition. Some of this involves re-doing entire cards, some just recoloring, some just minor tweaks, but I can say conclusively anything changed will be changed for the better.</p>",
